    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>osmund (also osemond), a superior quality of Swedish iron formerly imported from the Baltic regions, in very small bars or rods, for the manufacture of arrow-heads, fish-hooks, bell-gear, etc. (OED s.v. osmund1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
